[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]
\draw (0,0)--(4.6,0.8);
\draw (4.6,0.8)--(1.9,1.15);
\draw (1.9,1.15)--(1.2,3.2);
\draw (1.2,3.2)--(0,0);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Which statement about this quadrilateral is correct?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]
\draw (0,0.9)--(2.8,0);
\draw (2.8,0)--(4.6,1.8);
\draw (4.6,1.8)--(1.6,3.2);
\draw (1.6,3.2)--(0,0.9);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Which statement about this quadrilateral is correct?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.75]
\draw (0,0)--(5,1.2);
\draw (5,1.2)--(2.3,1);
\draw (2.3,1)--(1.6,3.4);
\draw (1.6,3.4)--(0,0);
\draw[dashed] (0,0)--(2.3,1);
\draw[dashed] (5,1.2)--(1.6,3.4);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
The two diagonals of this quadrilateral have been drawn.
What do they show?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]
\draw (0,0)--(4,1.4);
\draw (4,1.4)--(1.7,1.9);
\draw (1.7,1.9)--(1,3.6);
\draw (1,3.6)--(0,0);
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$A$};
\node[right] at (4,1.4) {$B$};
\node[right] at (1.7,1.9) {$C$};
\node[above] at (1,3.6) {$D$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
At which vertex of $ABCD$ is the interior angle reflex?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.8]
\draw (0,0)--(4.2,0.6);
\draw (4.2,0.6)--(1.8,1.2);
\draw (1.8,1.2)--(0.8,3.4);
\draw (0.8,3.4)--(0,0);
\draw[dashed] (0,0)--(1.8,1.2);
\node[below left] at (0,0) {$P$};
\node[right] at (4.2,0.6) {$Q$};
\node[above right] at (1.8,1.2) {$R$};
\node[above] at (0.8,3.4) {$S$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Zoe draws diagonal $PR$ of quadrilateral $PQRS$, sees that it lies inside the shape, and concludes that $PQRS$ is convex.
Which statement is correct?
